  <datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Uses both the kinetic and auditory aspects of the flag-book structure to create a flurry of thwacking and smacking hands. Printed on both sides of the hands, the text assembles and reassembles in a Mad Lib of curse and cuss. Both poetry and construction evoke the dog-eat-dog tension and petty backstabbing of the cramped urban environment.</subfield>
  </datafield>
